OL,3,GNEWSABake Off winner crowned after     
OL,4,Ahigh-stakes final                      
OL,6,FSpoiler warning: This story reveals    
OL,7,Fdetails of The Great British Bake Off  
OL,8,Ffinal                                  
OL,10,FMoyin Odeniran said he was "in shock"  
OL,11,Fafter being crowned the winner of the  
OL,12,F17th series of The Great British Bake  
OL,13,FOff.                                   
OL,15,FThe 22-year-old from Loughton, Essex,  
OL,16,Fdescribed it as a "very busy time" as  
OL,17,Fhe juggled competing in the Channel 4  
OL,18,Fbaking competition with completing his 
OL,19,Funiversity studies.                    
